{"id":"n15820-2-6","stage":2,"title":"바탕 · 本性","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15820-2-6-1","ko":"민준이한테 양복이 참 잘 어울리네.","zh":"敏俊穿西装真合适啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"민준이한테","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；한테：口语格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"민준이한테","audio":"/audio/61ffa7b81d49a5485c64.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"양복이","meaning":"西装","explanation":"양복：西装；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"양복","audio":"/audio/c7bd572874f1f999bedd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73257","senseId":"1","lemma":"양복","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"참","meaning":"真，实在，的确","explanation":"참：真，实在，的确","readings":[{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71761","senseId":"1","lemma":"참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘","meaning":"好看地，漂亮地","explanation":"잘：好看地，漂亮地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"10","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어울리네.","meaning":"谐调，相配，般配","explanation":"어울리다：谐调，相配，般配；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"어울리다","audio":"/audio/e3eff4fbd4afe320fdac.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67048","senseId":"4","lemma":"어울리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c7bd572874f1f999","term":"양복","zh":"西装","audio":"/audio/c7bd572874f1f999bedd.mp3","entryId":"73257","definition":"成年男子的西洋式正装。","pronunciation":["양복"]},{"id":"8e09b5f4c09195e3","term":"참","zh":"真，实在，的确","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3","entryId":"71761","definition":"毫不违背事实或道理，真正地。","pronunciation":["참"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"好看地，漂亮地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"非常帅气而美丽地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"e3eff4fbd4afe320","term":"어울리다","zh":"谐调，相配，般配","audio":"/audio/e3eff4fbd4afe320fdac.mp3","entryId":"67048","definition":"相互自然地达到和谐。","pronunciation":["어울리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a77e06196752419f3842.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15820-2-6-2","ko":"역시 바탕이 좋으니 뭘 입어도 멋지구나.","zh":"果然他底子好，穿什么都很帅呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"역시","meaning":"果然","explanation":"역시：果然","readings":[{"term":"역시","audio":"/audio/112d19723c425ab6813b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67372","senseId":"2","lemma":"역시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"바탕이","meaning":"本性，天资","explanation":"바탕：本性，天资；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"바탕","audio":"/audio/0764f371ef19fb899b53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15820","senseId":"2","lemma":"바탕","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋으니","meaning":"好，美，优良，优美","explanation":"좋다：好，美，优良，优美；으니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭘","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"2","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"입어도","meaning":"穿","explanation":"입다：穿；어도：表示让步：“即使、就算”；-아/어도 되다 表示“可以”。","readings":[{"term":"입다","audio":"/audio/5e126f454a274733cfa2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17174","senseId":"1","lemma":"입다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"멋지구나.","meaning":"帅气，潇洒，优秀","explanation":"멋지다：帅气，潇洒，优秀；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"멋지다","audio":"/audio/2b6551da3926436a9395.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15991","senseId":"1","lemma":"멋지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"112d19723c425ab6","term":"역시","zh":"果然","audio":"/audio/112d19723c425ab6813b.mp3","entryId":"67372","definition":"和所想的一样。","pronunciation":["역씨"]},{"id":"0764f371ef19fb89","term":"바탕","zh":"本性，天资","audio":"/audio/0764f371ef19fb899b53.mp3","entryId":"15820","definition":"与生俱来的性质或体质。","pronunciation":["바탕"]},{"i